", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1349828006517404_478951973652483237_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OB6z6EySlhMQ7kNvwFkJKNg&_nc_oc=AdoreR6aG4OQcQ9GQqUHOitVz_qLQv_fqoqdMCZBsyVZ2ePuNzzD1mDd2wdM0-H2huw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKs3l52CClrPb_gaJ8PWoZgV7-3s6RW6pS35oyHljTgeQ&oe=6AAAB8BB"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "2312823579179674", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821081_2312823582513007_124286550510138883_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRR7p8kRml4Q7kNvwG-_mEt&_nc_oc=Adoa-4W5fJf0FuZCwPZjYuDFyK3HQIwFEJLNiClRb-coSX4pnCA_HPoik3p9uFOHw-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ2ZMbuvbIJ9frvWxGH7V_BezGoXm_lPKMMCh999_Lunw&oe=6AAAB6DF"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "651228727814284", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_651228731147617_4134914421257978046_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xJCL2PTq_O8Q7kNvwHKyZQk&_nc_oc=AdoTWmlxLx3FXBQwCKLrTmMiXgYk6eqtBL-xlG6-vOvEDMyp-PoBKzf0a8cwO8OCUWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIolMp9ttY9JI9FRk0JJBmDiqCitb_ZX8bYzS1mEh082w&oe=6AAA90E3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LaunchTrailerThumbnail2560.png", "id": "1527450331696030", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1527450335029363_3687362586021231499_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aZjdtSpggbUQ7kNvwECyfr1&_nc_oc=Adopq-l5qiVDJJLaXcb_EXA8SSh7PcDI6oJ4d0hvKzauQFrwzVQHPv13rDQ0R2A9Z4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKM8L7xpFW-v3kPL6m4gmYez_2eFbQ7MovLfr_yJwCqsA&oe=6AAA9338"}, "display_name": "Crossings", "keywords": ["Combat", "fantasy", "swords", "viking"], "long_description": "**Block, dodge,** and **strike** your enemies in this action-adventure roguelite set in an ever-changing world inspired by old Norse myths.\n\nExperience Crossings in multiplayer co-op, either with a friend or connect to other players ambiently on your journey.\n\n{1857088914900175}\n\n# Combat\n\n- Wield blades, clubs, axes, and bows, each with multiple variants to shape your playstyle\n\n- Fight, block, and dodge Trolls, Draugr, Ghosts, and other beings drawn from Nordic folklore\n\n- Claim altar-born powers, trinkets, and upgrades to craft your own fighting style\n\n- Cast mighty spells using a gesture-based spell system designed specifically for VR\n\n- Face powerful bosses as you push deeper in search of the Nornir\n\n{1587364922279247}\n\n# Experience\n\n- Explore forests, ruins, and deep caves that reform with every run\n\n- Uncover hidden stories and rebuild the memory of a lost village, piece by piece\n\n- Learn from each fall and carry that knowledge into your next crossing\n\n- Seamless ambient and friend-based co-op, with crossplay with other platforms\n\n{4289831764578587}\n\nFight alone or stand side-by-side with others.\nEvery crossing leaves a mark, and every choice carries the weight of fate.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore and fight your way through an ever-changing world in a quest for vengeance and survival in an epic adventure through the Norse afterlife. Play co-op either with a friend or connect to other players ambiently, where you block, dodge, strike, and cast spells against Trolls, Draugr, and other dark beings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neatcorporation.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Creature Label", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://neatcorporation.com/crossings", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", 