tus": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "227233183761951"}]}, "change_log": "Fix game freezing and/or ending up in an unplayable state after loading corrupt save files", "created_date": 1782371587, "id": "28029724729946711", "version": "0.000727", "version_code": 727, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7631852763493874", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28029724729946711"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782213894, "id": "28009278948657956", "version": "0.000726", "version_code": 726, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7631852763493874", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28029724729946711"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "227233183761951"}]}, "change_log": "Major changes:\n* Save system! The game picks up where you left previously\n* P2P option for friend connect, with voice chat!\n\nMedium changes:\n* Throwing of potions! AOE effects where they land\n* Boom Goober! (throwable bomb)\n* Three inventory slots!\n* Draugr King fight reworked\n* NPCs lose health & stamina when pushed into walls, more-so when pushed into spikes (there are now more spikes)\n* Big environment stamps work again (more levelgen variety)\n* A lot of new encounter variations\n\nMinor changes:\n* Electricity eats NPC stamina while applied\n* NPC action-cancel animation are now increments of stamina meter\n* Captain taunting bugfixed\n* Player feet animation when standing still\n* Bugfix NPCs sometimes walking behind the player\n* NPCs walk in place a bit less\n* Draugrs now frenzy each-other\n* Some NPC rank tweaks\n* Some tree LOD popping fixed\n* Bugfix overriding master volume setting when game loses focus\n* Boss names no longer blurry\n* Bugfix some lootdrops giving debug loot\n* Enemies visually flinch when damaged by other player too\n* Removed decapitated troll heads from Matriarch boss encounter(s)\n* Patrolling Draugr in Jarl boss encounter\n* Sigi the betrayed hides before fight starts\n* Player always gets up to 3 hearts on revive\n* Allow gaining XP when dead\n* Don't auto-disconnect when game pauses if playing with friend\n* Credits updated & bugfixed\n* Lighting bugfixes on Act seams\n* Bugfix assassin getting dizzy by levelup wave\n* Enemies no longer frozen after Dizzy- & other states where they are not allowed to switch targets\n* Updated Draugr Elite & King weapon visuals\n* Player can break fragile objects with wind magic\n* NPCs can break planks with their swings\n* Draugr type animation speed variations\n* Dvergr Captain type animation speed variations\n* Massive lightning strike no longer follows enemies\n* Enemies spawned in boss fights now always aware of player\n* Loading the game goes faster after first launch\n* Lantern light tweaks\n* Save & Quit button\n* Frenzied effect now visible as glowing eyes on enemies\n* Draugr IK fix\n* More weapon drops\n* Animation driven hitboxes on enemies, makes them easier to hit during extreme animations\n* Lantern orb gather bugfix\n* Captain more steadfast\n* Tweaked bow tutorial\n* Removed trinket statues from magic themed clearings\n* Trinkets can sometimes drop from chests\n* XP gain reduced on Skuld & Urd difficulties, and other XP tweaks\n* Status effects on player no longer last forever\n* Friendly fire on electric fireball fixed\n* Physics engine performance improvements\n* Volumetric fog performance improvements\n* NPC stamina tweaks\n* Beam spells go through enemies and damage multiple in a line\n* Spell upgrade cost tweaks\n* Weapon tear cost tweaks\n* More level transition variations\n* Blacksmith wares tweaks\n* More combo variety\n* New runestone designs\n* Elite Captain Draupner tweaks\n* Some collision bugfixes\n* Viking phone UX improvements\n* Various loot table tweaks\n* Various sword & axe tweaks\n* Elite NPC variations have more distinct looks\n* New improved \"electrified\" status on NPCs\n* Labyrinth more despair\n* Poison potion tier tweaks\n* Randomized weapon stats bugfixed\n* Automatic potion swapping\n* Explosion force tweaks\n* NPC fall damage tweaks\n* Drinking polish\n* Allow giving potions to friend\n* Spear-troll mouths closed", "created_date": 1779548998, "id": "27614257961493392", "version": "0.000725", "version_code": 725, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7631852763493874", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28029724729946711"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1779438884, "id": "27600065412912647", "version": "0.000724", "version_code": 724, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 2}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAp